      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u7684\u503c\uff1a\na) $2.345\\times100$\uff1b\nb) $3.71\\div10$\uff1b\nc) $1000\\times0.07$\uff1b\nd) $0.031\\times10000$\uff1b\ne) $5.1\\times0.3$\uff1b\nf) $0.46\\div0.2$\uff1b\ng) $4.16\\div4$\uff1b\nh) $0\\times17.3$.",
