    {
      "number": "7",
      "text": "\u4e0b\u9762\u54ea\u51e0\u4e2a\u5f0f\u5b50\u6ca1\u6709\u610f\u4e49\uff1f\na) $\\frac{7.845}{4.18-2.09\\times2}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{6\\frac{1}{4}}{2\\frac{1}{3}\\times9-20}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{5\\frac{1}{3}-8\\frac{1}{6}}{0.8-1.2\\times\\frac{2}{3}}$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{4-10.7}{1.68\\div4.2-2.5\\times0.16}$.",
